            <ArticleTitle>[The vascular manifestations of Behçet's disease: a case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>86-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Behçet's disease is an inflammatory vasculitis which affects the arteries and veins. The vascular pathologies are the rare complications of this disease. We present here a patient with Behçet's disease who has been hospitalized several times because of plurifocal vascular manifestations.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
